:1.5em"><strong>Story Finding:</strong> Speak with engineers, founders and colleagues working with customers to find the result, observation or argument worth sharing, and understand the evidence behind it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Writing &amp; Editing:</strong> Write and edit essays, product explanations, short technical papers, website copy and social posts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Founder Voice:</strong> Help the founders express their ideas in their own voices and build a consistent presence across founder and company channels.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Publishing:</strong> Take pieces from first draft through feedback and publication, choose the audience, format, channel and timing with the founders, and learn from the response.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Talks &amp; Announcements:</strong> Prepare interviews, talks and announcements by researching the audience and finding useful examples and questions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Visual Material:</strong> Plan photographs and footage before important tests, visits and events with our creative director and specialist photographers or filmmakers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Accuracy &amp; Approvals:</strong> Keep drafts and sources organised, check claims with the people who know, and obtain approvals before publishing.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Your Profile</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You take responsibility for finishing what you start, raise a concern when a draft is wrong and use direct feedback to improve your work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You write excellent English, with samples that show independent thought and careful revision. Your best work might come from a student publication, an internship, a personal blog or a research project.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're a recent graduate or have up to three years of experience. Previous full-time communications experience is not required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're curious about technology and can research, check facts and explain complex subjects without losing what matters.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have good editorial judgement and notice unsupported claims, empty phrases and details that change the meaning of a sentence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're based in Munich or willing to relocate. Strong German is a plus, particularly for work with German customers and institutions. Given the nature of SE3's work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to work on defence-related projects and, where required, obtain the relevant security clearance.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Especially Valued Bonus Skills</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong spoken &amp; written German.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interest in technology, science, defence or public policy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience interviewing people and preparing questions in depth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A body of writing on technical or complex subjects.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Perks &amp; Benefits</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real Ownership:</strong> Participate in SE3's growth through our employee participation programme</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work Environment to Excel at:</strong> Find a high-quality and modern toolset, flat hierarchy and a skilled, driven team which will push the limits together with you</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI-boosted workplace:</strong> We empower every employee with best-in-class AI tools and agents, giving you unlimited access to the latest advancements and a true productivity edge</p><