31083},{"slug":"chief-financial-officer-cfo-rijssen-404720","company_name":"Voortman Steel Machinery","title":"Chief Financial Officer (CFO)","description":"<h2><span style="color:#4f5357">Wat ga je doen?</span></h2><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Samen met de CEO en COO werk je aan de verdere strategische en financiële ontwikkeling van de organisatie. Als CFO vertaal je de ondernemingsstrategie naar concrete groeikansen door schaalbare verdien- en prijsmodellen te ontwikkelen. Per markt, regio, entiteit, businessunit en klantsegment analyseer je waar kansen liggen, op basis van verwachte klantwaarde, omzetpotentieel, kosten, marge, cashflow, risico en schaalbaarheid. Deze inzichten verwerk je in businesscases waarin zowel het perspectief van de klant als van Voortman Steel Machinery naar voren komen.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Daarnaast ontwikkel je heldere investeringskaders en breng je passende financieringsmodellen in kaart die aansluiten op de aard van de activiteiten en de internationale context. Daarbij weeg je beschikbare financieringsopties zorgvuldig af op impact, liquiditeit en rendement. Op basis daarvan adviseer je de board over prioriteiten en zorg je dat middelen terechtkomen bij de initiatieven die het meest bijdragen aan de strategische en financiële doelstellingen van Voortman Steel Machinery. Als onderdeel hiervan bepaal je ook onder welke financiële en organisatorische voorwaarden pilots kunnen worden gestart en opgeschaald. Met heldere go/no-go-momenten per fase zorg je ervoor dat de ontwikkeling en implementatie van nieuwe verdien- en prijsmodellen niet sneller gaat dan wat de organisatie kan adopteren. Daarnaast monitor je de financiële resultaten van nieuwe verdien- en prijsmodellen en bepaal je of de uitrol moet worden versneld, voortgezet, bijgestuurd of afgeschaald. Tegelijkertijd borg je dat contracten allesomvattende afspraken en een evenwichtige risicoverdeling bevatten, evenals uitvoerbaar zijn in alle landen waar Voortman Steel Machinery actief is. Zo werk je gericht aan verdien- en prijsmodellen die commercieel aantrekkelijk, financieel gezond en schaalbaar zijn.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Als CFO draag je actief bij aan de verdere internationale groei van Voortman Steel Machinery. Hiervoor ontwikkel je strategische, financiële en organisatorische plannen, zodat per markt en internationale entiteit helder is welke inrichting het beste past bij de gewenste groei. Daarbij verzorg je de afstemming tussen verschillende afdelingen en entiteiten, zonder de lijnverantwoordelijkheid van collega's over te nemen. Tevens bewaak je per land en internationale entiteit het rendement, de cashflow, het werkkapitaal en houd je zicht op financiële, juridische, fiscale, contractuele en compliance-risico’s.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Ook de financiële besturing en beheersing van Voortman Steel Machinery valt onder jouw verantwoordelijkheid. Je bent internationaal eindverantwoordelijk voor consolidatie, planning &amp; control, reporting, accounting, treasury, audit, tax, vennootschapsbelasting en interne beheersing. Aansluitend zie je toe op het opstellen van correcte en transparante rapportages per internationale entiteit. De dagelijkse coördinatie van deze verschillende activiteiten en de aansturing van de Finance-afdeling wordt verzorgd door de Finance-director, waarmee je nauw samenwerkt. Jij fungeert als sparringpartner, stuurt bij waar nodig, bewaakt de strategisch richting van de Finance-afdeling, verzorgt correcte governance en behandeld onderwerpen met board impact. Tevens ben je het gezicht van Voortman Steel Machinery richting banken, verzekeraars, accountant en andere financiële stakeholders.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Wat maakt deze rol uniek?</span></strong></h2><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">In deze rol krijg je de kans om zichtbaar richting te geven aan de volgende groeifase van Voortman Steel Machinery. Je komt terecht in een organisatie waar ondernemerschap, innovatie en slagkracht samenkomen: ideeën worden niet alleen verkend, maar ook scherp getoetst op waardecreatie, rendement, risico en schaalbaarheid. Daarmee krijg je ruimte om jouw financiële expertise en strategisch vermogen in te zetten bij het ontwikkelen van nieuwe proposities, het onderbouwen van businesscases en het bepalen van investeringskeuzes die impact hebben op de internationale groei van de organisatie. Dit maakt de functie nadrukkelijk méér dan een traditionele CFO-rol: je bewaakt niet alleen de financiële basis, maar bent medebepalend in hoe Voortman Steel Machinery commerciële kansen vertaalt naar gezonde, schaalbare en toekomstbestendige groei.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Positie binnen de organisatie</span></strong></h2><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Voortman Steel Machinery ontwikkelt machines, software en serviceoplossingen waarmee staalverwerkende bedrijven hun productieprocessen automatiseren en optimaliseren. Het hoofdkantoor is gevestigd in Nederland. Dankzij vestigingen in verschillende landen kan effectieve lokale ondersteuning worden geboden. De recent geopende, grootschalige productielocatie in de Verenigde Staten laat zien hoe de organisatie internationaal blijft groeien. Tevens vindt in Engeland hoofdzakelijk de ontwikkeling van onze LogicSteel-software plaats. Daarnaast bezit Voortman wereldwijd diverse sales &amp; service-hubs.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Als CFO vorm je samen met de CEO en COO de board van Voortman Steel Machinery, geef je met hen richting aan de ontwikkeling van het Global Management Team en de organisatie als geheel. Jouw focus ligt op het vertalen van de ondernemingsstrategie naar concrete kansen voor nieuwe verdien- en prijsmodellen. Hierbij werk je intensief samen met de afdeling Product Management, dat verantwoordelijk is voor het identificeren en ontwikkelen van software-, machine- en serviceproposities. Als CFO ben je eindverantwoordelijk voor de Finance-afdeling en werk je nauw samen met de Finance Director, die de dagelijkse internationale operationele aansturing van de afdeling verzorgt. Tevens rapporteren de HR-Manager en Trade Compliance Officer aan jou. De HR-Manager is (mede) verantwoordelijk voor het ontwikkelen van de HR-strategie en het borgen van de operationele uitvoering. Daarnaast ziet de Trade Compliance Officer erop toe dat de organisatie voldoet aan de relevante wet- en regelgeving. Daarbij bewaakt de Trade Compliance Officer onder andere de inhoudelijke juistheid en werking van ingezette maatregelen.</span></p> <br> <h2><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Wat wij bieden?</span></strong></h2><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Bij Voortman Steel Machinery kom je terecht in een écht familiebedrijf met een informele, betrokken en ondernemende cultuur. Mensen kennen elkaar en lijnen zijn kort. Er is volop ruimte om verantwoordelijkheid te nemen, initiatief te tonen en ideeën verder te brengen. Onze kernwaarden ondernemerschap, vakmanschap, passie voor technologie, toewijding en samenwerking vormen daarbij de basis voor hoe we werken en met elkaar omgaan. Je ziet ze terug in de trots waarmee we hoogwaardige technologie ontwikkelen, in de manier waarop teams elkaar versterken en in de gezamenlijke drive om klanten vooruit te helpen. Zo ontstaat een werkomgeving waarin ambitie, betrokkenheid en werkplezier op een natuurlijke manier samenkomen.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Naast een professionele, ondernemende en loyale werkomgeving krijg je bij ons:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#4f5357">Een marktconform salaris, passend bij jouw kennis en ervaring;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#4f5357">Een passende pensioenregeling bij ASR, waarbij jij en Voortman samen pensioenkapitaal opbouwen;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#4f5357">Een leaseauto voor zakelijk en privégebruik;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#4f5357">Een sleutelrol in het realiseren van onze strategie met internationale impact;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#4f5357">Werken in een moderne omgeving op onze Voortman Campus in Rijssen;</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Wat breng je mee?</span></strong></h2><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Wij zoeken een ondernemende, strategische en daadkrachtige CFO met een afgeronde masteropleiding in Finance, Economie, Bedrijfskunde of een vergelijkbare richting. Een titel als RA, RC of CPA is een must. Je hebt minimaal vijf jaar ervaring als CFO, Divisie-CFO, Senior Finance Director, Head of Finance of Director Corporate Finance, bij voorkeur binnen een internationale </span><em><span style="color:#4f5357">original equipment manufacturer</span></em><span style="color:#4f5357"> (OEM), industrieel technologiebedrijf, technisch complexe B2B-organisatie of top-tier consultancybureau. Ervaring binnen een ondernemend familiebedrijf of een organisatie van vergelijkbare omvang en complexiteit is daarbij een pré. Daarnaast heb je ervaring met aansturen van een finance-afdeling of -team. Verder voldoe je aan het volgende profiel:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Strategisch en analytisch vermogen:</span></strong><span style="color:#4f5357"> je beschikt over sterk analytisch en strategisch vermogen en hebt aantoonbare ervaring met het doorgronden van complexe data en businessmodellen. Je weet informatie te vertalen naar heldere strategische en financiële logica, logische transparante aannames en goed onderbouwde besluitvorming. Je bent in staat om richting te bepalen, langetermijndoelen te formuleren en de organisatie daarin mee te nemen.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Businessmodelinnovatie:</span></strong><span style="color:#4f5357"> je hebt aantoonbare ervaring met het in kaart brengen van groeikansen en het ontwikkelen van nieuwe (schaalbare) verdien-, prijs- en contractmodellen. Deze weet je te onderbouwen met solide businesscases en scenarioanalyses. Daarnaast heb je ruime ervaring met het ontwikkelen van financieringsmodellen en het inrichten van kapitaalallocatie op basis van het (verwachte) rendement, risico’s en strategische bijdrage.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Besluitvaardig en resultaatgericht:</span></strong><span style="color:#4f5357"> je bent besluitvaardig en kunt tijdig en doordacht keuzes maken op basis van beschikbare informatie. Als je éénmaal een keuze hebt gemaakt, durf je achter je keuze te blijven staan. Je beschikt over overtuigingskracht, kunt draagvlak creëren en interne en externe stakeholders zorgvuldig meenemen in strategische veranderingen. Tevens stuur je actief op concrete resultaten en realiseer je aantoonbare positieve financiële impact.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Verandervermogen en omgevingsbewustzijn:</span></strong><span style="color:#4f5357"> je hebt ervaring met het realiseren van interne veranderingen en de implementatie van nieuwe verdien- en prijsmodellen, evenals het tijdig bijsturen daarvan. Tevens ben je sterk in het vertalen van nieuwe verdien- en prijsmodellen naar heldere, beheersbare processen en rollen. Daarbij zorg je voor een gestructureerde stapsgewijze implementatie en ben je sterk in het meenemen en begeleiden van collega’s tijdens veranderingen. Ook onder druk en in complexe situaties blijf je rustig, behoud je overzicht en kun je snel schakelen. Tevens heb je een scherp oog voor verhoudingen, kun je belangen goed afwegen en anticipeer je tijdig op ontwikkelingen. Daarbij heb je een goed begrip van culturele en organisatorische verschillen in een internationale context.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Verbindend vermogen en communicatie: </span></strong><span style="color:#4f5357">je bent betrokken en weet duurzame professionele relaties op te bouwen en te onderhouden met interne en externe stakeholders, zoals banken, accountants en verzekeraars. Je communiceert helder, informeert betrokkenen tijdig over relevante ontwikkelingen en bent benaderbaar. Je weet complexe onderwerpen begrijpelijk over te brengen en stemt je communicatie af op verschillende gesprekspartners. Daarnaast beschik je over sterke Nederlandse en Engelse communicatieve vaardigheden, zowel mondeling als schriftelijk.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Inspirerend leiderschap:</span></strong><span style="color:#4f5357"> jouw leiderschap is gericht op groei, vertrouwen en ontwikkeling. Je weet medewerkers te coachen, te inspireren en richting te geven, terwijl je ruimte geeft voor eigenaarschap en verantwoordelijkheid. Daarbij stuur je bij waar nodig, stimuleer je samenwerking en help je collega’s hun potentieel te benutten. Zo draag je bij aan een omgeving waarin mensen zich betrokken voelen en werken aan gezamenlijke doelen.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#4f5357">Onafhankelijke en reflectieve houding:</span></strong><span style="color:#4f5357"> je hebt een onafhankelijke, kritische en constructieve houding, staat open voor feedback, kunt je eigen handelen kritisch evalueren en wilt continu blijven leren.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:1920px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/e1agb71ecwof6s7y179o2lv61g55gv/Visual_vacancy.png"></figure><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style="color:#4f5357">Nieuwsgierig?</span></h2><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#4f5357">Ben jij dé ondernemende en daadkrachtige Chief Financial Officer (CFO) die strategie weet te vertalen naar waarde, nieuwe verdienmodellen tot leven brengt, internationale groei mede realiseert en de organisatie met visie en resultaatgerichtheid stuurt? Solliciteer dan nu en word onderdeel van onze organisatie! Na ontvangst beoordelen wij jouw sollicitatie en nemen we binnen twee werkdagen contact met je op. Zijn wij net als jij positief, dan nodigen we je graag uit voor een eerste sollicitatiegesprek op locatie. Bij een positieve uitkomst volgt een tweede en mogelijk derde sollicitatiegesprek. Ter voorbereiding op het derde sollicitatiegesprek willen we je vragen een assessment te maken, waarmee meer inzicht wordt verkregen in jouw cognitieve capaciteiten, drijfveren en persoonlijkheid. Met jouw goedkeuring bespreken we vervolgens de uitkomsten, behandelen we een casus en wordt een referentie- en achtergrondcheck uitgevoerd. Wil je eerst meer weten over de functie, Voortman Steel Machinery of sollicitatieprocedure, neem dan contact op met Guus Regelink via </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ----- ----- style="color:#4f5357"> of 0626393850.</span></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/voortman-steel-machinery/chief-financial-officer-cfo-rijssen-404720","tags":["Staff & Management"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Rijssen, Overijssel, Nederland","created_at":1792431083},{"slug":"sales-director-international-ote-eur150000-per-year-breda-343304","company_name":"Whitevision B.V.","title":"Sales Director (International), OTE €150.000 per year | Breda","description":"<p style="text-align:center;"><strong>You hit targets. But what you really want is to build.</strong></p><p style="text-align:center;"><strong>You know how to deliver ARR targets. What really gets you going is building a sales organisation that’s ready for the next stage of growth. Sound like you? Read on.</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW87322870 BCX0" style="text-align:center;"><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong>&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW87322870 BCX0"><strong>Your role<br></strong>As Sales Director, you’re the CCO’s operational and tactical right hand on sales management. The CCO holds ultimate responsibility for the group result and the strategic relationships. You make sure we deliver our ARR targets, day in, day out. You keep the sales team sharp, focused and on track. Customer Success and expansion also fall under your leadership.</p><p>This is explicitly more than running today’s team. You help build tomorrow’s. You translate the group’s growth strategy (vertical specialisation, internationalisation and portfolio expansion) into the commercial capacity and structure we’ll need next. You also help build the playbook that lets sales teams from new acquisitions integrate smoothly into the group.</p><p>You report to the CCO. Together with the CCO and the Marketing Director, you form the Commercial MT (CMT). You also work closely with the Leadership Team (LT).</p><p>Day to day, you and the Marketing Director make sure the commercial disciplines work together seamlessly: from lead to pipeline to revenue. You make clear agreements on MQLs, SQLs and forecasting. That collaboration has to be ultra-tight.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW87322870 BCX0" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>What you’ll do</strong><br>Revenue &amp; results</p><p>You’re operationally responsible for delivering the group’s ARR targets, day in, day out. That covers new business, upsell and cross-sell, and retention and expansion through Customer Success.</p><p>You translate the commercial strategy (set with and by the CCO and the Commercial MT) into concrete sales goals, targets per country and team, and an actionable sales plan.</p><p>You drive pipeline, conversion and forecast accuracy. You own the sales funnel from SQL to closed-won, and the expansion funnel within our existing customer base.</p><p>You’re responsible for pricing and deal structure within the agreed framework, in line with our margin and growth targets.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Leadership &amp; team</em><br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You lead and further professionalise the sales team (about 15 FTE) day to day, across all countries where Whitevision operates. That includes visiting our offices and teams at the various locations.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You directly lead Customer Success (currently 2 FTE) as part of the broader sales and expansion motion. As the team grows, this structure can grow with it.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You decide on team structure, capacity and how accounts and verticals are divided, to fit our international growth.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You coach, develop and recruit sales professionals. You also own onboarding and enablement for new colleagues.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You drive individual and team performance with clear KPIs and a healthy rhythm of 1:1s, forecast reviews and pipeline meetings.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Building &amp; integrating<br></em><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You set up and safeguard scalable sales processes, CRM and tooling that grow with a fast-growing, international buy-and-build organisation.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You own the sales methodology, from qualification through negotiation to closing. You make sure every country and team applies it the same way.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You (co-)develop and execute the playbook for integrating sales teams of newly acquired companies: one sales methodology, one CRM, one way of working.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You spot operational bottlenecks in the commercial organisation and resolve them.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Collaboration &amp; execution<br></em><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You work closely with the Marketing Director on lead follow-up, campaign ROI, events, partners and a consistent go-to-market.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You support the CCO in the commercial execution of strategic partnerships, including AFAS, 4PS, Exact and other partners.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You report on sales performance, pipeline and risks to the CCO and the Commercial MT.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You travel regularly to our international teams and customers.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW37084677 BCX0" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>About Whitevision</strong></p><p>Whitevision is a fast-growing SaaS organisation. We specialise in intelligent document processing and automating document-intensive workflows. Through an ambitious buy-and-build strategy, we’re bringing several software companies together into one strong, international platform. We’re active across Europe, and the US is likely next.</p><p>Our mission is clear: build one strong, recognisable and scalable company. One Company. The coming years are all about international growth, integration and commercial professionalisation. For this next phase, we’re looking for a Sales Director who doesn’t just deliver results, but also builds the organisation that makes the next stage of growth possible.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:center;"><em>"At Whitevision, we provide a solution that genuinely helps people move forward in their organizations. It enables them to work more efficiently and effectively, allowing them to make a greater impact. Our team is stable and consists of a great mix of experience, personalities, and backgrounds. That diversity is one of our strengths. We also enjoy spending time together outside of work, whether it's a game of padel or a limoncello workshop." <span style="color:#525664">Erik, Sales Manager</span></em><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p> <br> <p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/akhop7ylnwwscr12ed7ypmd3go9ldd/Foto_vacature_recruitee_5.png"></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW54402936 BCX0"><strong>What you bring<br></strong><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> 2–4 years of sales management experience, including at least one year in an end-responsible role (Sales Director or Head of Sales) in B2B SaaS or software.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> A successful track record of at least 4 years as an individual contributor in SaaS sales.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> A proven track record of hitting MRR/ARR targets and scaling a sales team in a fast-growing environment.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> Experience (co-)building a sales organisation. You’ve put structure, process and capacity in place for the next phase, not just run an existing team.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You’re data- and process-driven. You build processes, rhythm and discipline, and you steer on data and forecasts.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> An affinity for Customer Success and retention, alongside new business sales.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> Experience leading sales teams across multiple countries and cultures. You’re a leader people want to follow, and the teams you’ve led will tell you so.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> Experience in a scale-up or buy-and-build SaaS environment is a strong plus.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> You’re a natural sparring partner for marketing. You think in terms of the full funnel, not just your own team.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> Excellent English. Good Dutch is a plus, as is fluency in a third European language.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure style="text-align:center;"><img style="width:920px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/348sas9gp8/Lijn_vacatures.png"></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW227108944 BCX0" style="text-align:center;"><em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#5a5f72">Our Whitevision way of working is built on respect, decisiveness, commitment and ambition. These core values are an excellent match with your personality and the way you approach your work.</span></span></em><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW227108944 BCX0"><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure style="text-align:center;"><img style="width:920px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/348sas9gp8/Lijn_vacatures.png"></figure><p class="Paragraph SCXW54402936 BCX0">&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW54402936 BCX0"><strong>What we offer<br></strong><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> OTE of €150,000 per year, depending on your experience. We’ll discuss the split, accelerators and caps on the variable part together.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> A company car, laptop, mobile phone and a solid pension plan.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> An executive role with direct, operational impact on our commercial result and on building a fast-growing international SaaS organisation.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> Close collaboration in a small, decisive Commercial MT: the CCO, the Marketing Director and you.<br><span style="color:#FCC200">+</span> The chance to help build tomorrow’s Sales and Customer Success organisation, including integrating new acquisitions.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW54402936 BCX0">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Ready to drive our commercial engine?<br></strong>Are you the Sales Director who’ll drive Whitevision’s commercial engine? Can you see yourself forming the Commercial MT with the CCO and the Marketing Director? Then we’d love to hear from you.</p><p>Excited? Get in touch. We’re curious to hear your story. Want to know more about this vacancy? Call us on +31 (0)76 560 7820.</p><p><em>We kindly ask recruitment agencies not to contact us about this vacancy.</em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/whitevision-bv/sales-director-international-ote-eur150000-per-year-breda-343304","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Breda, Noord-Brabant, Nederland","created_at":1792431083},{"slug":"director-of-pricing-monetization-amsterdam-141967","company_name":"Nuvei","title":"Director of Pricing & Monetization","description":"<p>The world of payment processing is rapidly evolving, and businesses are looking for loyal and strategic partners, to help them grow.</p><p><strong>Meet Nuvei</strong>, the Canadian fintech company accelerating the business of clients around the world. Nuvei's modular, flexible and scalable technology allows leading companies to accept next-gen payments, offer all payout options and benefit from card issuing, banking, risk and fraud management services. Connecting businesses to their customers in more than 200 markets, with local acquiring in 50 markets, 150 currencies and 700 alternative payment methods, Nuvei provides the technology and insights for customers and partners to succeed locally and globally with one integration.</p><p>At Nuvei, we live our core values, and we thrive on solving complex problems. We’re dedicated to continually improving our product and providing relentless customer service.&nbsp;&nbsp; We are always looking for exceptional talent to join us on the journey!</p><p></p><p><strong>Your Mission&nbsp; </strong></p><p>We are looking for a <strong>Director of Pricing &amp; Monetization</strong>, who will be responsible for defining and executing the company's pricing strategy to maximize revenue growth, profitability, and market competitiveness. This leader will develop scalable pricing frameworks, design bundled product offerings, lead willingness-to-pay research, and establish a data-driven approach to pricing across products, industries, customer segments, and geographies.&nbsp;The role sits at the intersection of Commercial, Marketing, Finance, Data Analytics &amp; Product, ensuring pricing decisions balance customer value, competitive positioning, profitability, and growth objectives.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p><strong>Responsibilities&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Pricing Framework Development&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Design and maintain the company's enterprise-wide pricing framework.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Develop attribute-based pricing models across products, industries, geographies, customer segments, and risk profiles.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Establish pricing governance, policies, guardrails, and decision-making frameworks.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Create methodologies for standard pricing, exception pricing, strategic discounts, and deal approvals.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Define pricing architecture for new products and market launches.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Bundling &amp; Monetization Strategy&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Design and implement bundled product and service offerings that maximize customer value and company profitability.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Identify opportunities to unbundle and re-bundle products to improve monetization and customer segmentation.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Develop packaging strategies across core products, value-added services, premium features, and subscriptions.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Partner with Product Management to create tiered "Good-Better-Best" pricing structures.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Measure bundle performance and continuously optimize package economics.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Willingness-to-Pay &amp; Customer Research&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Lead willingness-to-pay studies and pricing research programs.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Develop segmentation models based on customer value perception and purchasing behavior.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Conduct customer interviews, surveys, conjoint analysis, Van Westendorp studies, and other pricing methodologies.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Identify pricing drivers by industry, customer size, region, and product category.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Translate customer insights into actionable pricing recommendations.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Market &amp; Competitive Intelligence&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Build and maintain a competitive pricing intelligence program.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Monitor competitor pricing structures, packaging strategies, discounting practices, and market trends.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Conduct benchmarking analyses to evaluate pricing position versus competitors.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Identify emerging monetization strategies and disruptive pricing models.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Provide executive recommendations on pricing actions required to maintain market competitiveness.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Pricing Analytics &amp; Optimization&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Develop pricing elasticity models and price-volume curves.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Establish analytical frameworks to measure profitability, margin performance, and pricing effectiveness.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Evaluate revenue impact of pricing changes before deployment.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Track pricing KPIs and identify opportunities for revenue optimization.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Support AI-driven and data-driven pricing initiatives.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Cross-Functional Leadership&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Partner closely with Product, Finance, Commercial, Revenue Operations, Marketing, and Data teams.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Influence product roadmap decisions through monetization insights.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Support executive leadership on strategic pricing investments and initiatives.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Lead pricing councils, governance forums, and strategic pricing reviews.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Manage and develop a high-performing pricing team.&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Qualifications&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>8+ years of experience in Pricing, Strategy, Product Management, Revenue Management, Consulting, or Commercial Excellence.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>4+ years leading pricing strategy or monetization initiatives.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Demonstrated experience building pricing frameworks and governance models.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Strong background in market research and willingness-to-pay methodologies.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Experience designing pricing bundles, packaging strategies, and commercial offers.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Experience driving pricing transformations in complex organizations.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Preferred Experience&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Payments, fintech, SaaS, software, technology, telecommunications, financial services, or marketplace experience.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Experience with CPQ platforms, pricing systems, and revenue management tools.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Knowledge of advanced pricing analytics, AI-driven pricing, and revenue optimization.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p>Specific benefits and details about what compensation is included in the salary range listed above will vary depending on the applicant’s location and can be discussed in more detail during the interview process.</p><p>Nuvei is an equal-opportunity employer that celebrates collaboration and innovation and is committed to developing a diverse and inclusive workplace. The team at Nuvei is comprised of a wealth of talent, skill, and ambition. We believe that employees are happiest when they’re empowered to be their true, authentic selves. <em><strong>So, please come as you are. We can’t wait to meet you.&nbsp;</strong></em></p><p><strong>Working Language&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>English (written and spoken) is the language used most of the time, as work colleagues,&nbsp;clients, and strategic suppliers&nbsp;are geographically dispersed.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>****Our recruitment process may use automated tools, including AI, to support application management and candidate shortlisting.</p><p><em>The annual salary range for this role in the </em><em><strong>Netherlands </strong></em><em>is </em><em><strong>EUR 123,000 - EUR 130,000 (gross)</strong></em><em>. This range represents the expected starting salary for candidates hired into this role in the specified location. If the position is filled in a different location, a different salary range may apply due to objective factors such as local labor market conditions and cost of living.</em><br> <br> <em>This salary range may be inclusive of several career levels at Nuvei&nbsp;and will be narrowed during the interview process based on a number of factors, including the candidate’s experience, qualifications, and specific location. Applicants not located in the primary location may request the annual salary range for their location during the interview process.</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nuvei/director-of-pricing-monetization-amsterdam-141967","tags":["Marketing","Financial Services","Client Engagement & Marketing"],"job_types":["Full time","mid-senior"],"location":"Amsterdam, Netherlands","created_at":1792423220},{"slug":"senior-backend-engineer-vgo-carrier-technology-amsterdam-439018","company_name":"Vinteden","title":"Senior Backend Engineer, VGo Carrier Technology","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Backend Engineer in the Vinted Go Carrier domain, you will build backend systems that move parcels through Vinted Go&#39;s own logistics network, between hubs and through warehouses, quickly, reliably and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join Vinted Go, the logistics arm of Vinted, focused on making shipping more affordable, convenient, and reliable. Your team, &lt;strong&gt;Pacman&lt;/strong&gt;, owns mid-mile logistics and warehouse operations automation: how parcels are routed and transported between hubs, and how they are received, labelled, and dispatched.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a strong engineer who also makes the engineers around them better: someone who leads the team&#39;s hardest technical problems and actively shares what they know, so the whole team grows with them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable backend services and APIs that power mid-mile transport and warehouse operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical initiatives end to end, from problem framing and system design through delivery, monitoring, and iteration, and lead projects that span the team or the wider domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architecture and trade-off decisions with a 6–12 month horizon, balancing scalability, reliability, maintainability, and tech debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve our core service, a large Ruby on Rails modular monolith, towards clearer module boundaries and well-defined APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Operations, Decision Science, and neighboring engineering teams to shape discovery, sequencing, and implementation, and align on contracts and dependencies through RFCs and technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively share knowledge: give thoughtful code reviews, pair on hard problems, walk the team through complex changes, and keep documentation useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help onboard new team members, mentor engineers informally, and trust others with meaningful work while supporting them to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a backend stack that includes Ruby, Vitess, Kafka, Jenkins, Elastic, and observability tools; you do not need to know all of it upfront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of service reliability, alerts, metrics, SLOs, and incident follow-up, including participation in on-call rotations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in hiring by interviewing candidates and helping raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools thoughtfully to improve your development workflow and help the team move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of backend engineering experience, with a track record of building systems and owning work from design through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Ruby, or the ability and motivation to learn Vinted&#39;s backend stack quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of API design, database-backed systems, observability, and operating services in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works independently on problems of diverse scope, and is someone teammates turn to for advice on difficult technical matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic problem solver who balances delivery speed, reliability, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with ambiguity and breaking complex product or operational problems into clear technical steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely enjoys sharing knowledge and mentoring others, and sees raising the team&#39;s engineering standards as part of the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gives direct, useful feedback, seeks it in return, and builds alignment across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and clear communicator who works well with engineers, product managers, operations, and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: experience with logistics, warehouse management, fulfillment, or operational workflows; integrating software with physical devices; or modularizing a large monolith.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to all the tools &amp;amp; tech needed for work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Private health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pension plan with flexible contribution options and a matching contribution from Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In Vilnius office: Gym &amp;amp; in-house meals at friendly prices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In Kaunas office: a monthly lunch allowance, and a once-a-week provided in-house lunch and breakfast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€104.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/vinteden/senior-backend-engineer-vgo-carrier-technology-amsterdam-439018","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792421718},{"slug":"director-of-engineering-frontend-technologies-marketplace-technologies-amsterdam-284115","company_name":"Vinteden","title":"Director of Engineering, Frontend technologies, Marketplace Technologies","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Director of Engineering to lead the Frontend Technologies domain within Marketplace. In this role, your mission will be two-fold:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pivot our frontend setup for bigger efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;: we have been operating in mostly the same frontend setup for at least 6 years, and recognize that change is imminent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategic engineering initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;: architect and implement platform-specific changes that enhance modularity, autonomy, resilience, and performance across Android, iOS, and Web.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have to balance and prioritize foundational capabilities - such as Design Systems, CI/CD, Modularization, App Releases, Performance, and Global UI quality - to optimize both frontend developer velocity and user satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead 4 Engineering Managers and 3 Staff Engineers and set and implement the FE strategy, which will impact the roadmaps of 9 Product domains within the Marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategically:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure the most effective frontend setup for the Marketplace.&lt;/strong&gt; We have 40+ teams, each with 3 frontend engineers (iOS, Android, and Web) in the Marketplace unit. We know this will look different in two years. Deciding what different means, and getting 9 product domains to fund it, is the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technology Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Set and drive the future technology strategy for frontends, establishing a modular, scalable architecture that enables rapid development and strategic growth. Basically - raise the technological bar for all Marketplace unit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine the domain&#39;s identity: &lt;/strong&gt;Take sole ownership of shaping its future, successfully integrating Design Systems and engineering to treat our frontend platforms as a cohesive product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tactically&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead frontends:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead a horizontal, platform-focused domain containing Android, iOS, Web, and Design System teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee Marketplace-wide technical tooling, core libraries, and frameworks. Lead strategic projects, i.e., frontend modularization and modernization (SwiftUI/Jetpack Compose), native automated testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate global UI quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate design systems and accessibility into the frontend ecosystem to consolidate technical, visual and interaction quality standards. Support UI experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Resilience &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain robust release processes, Marketplace frontend quality, and performance monitoring to reduce downtime and ensure a consistent member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate &amp;amp; Optimize:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive AI-efficiency enablement in frontend development and explore cross-platform frontend development opportunities to increase engineering speed and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A lot of this work will be influencing without formal authority&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the frontend technical vision among your director peers, influencing the leaders of 9 Product domains to accommodate and prioritize platform-wide changes across 40+ teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How much of a technical acumen? &lt;/strong&gt;Enough to have in depth conversations with our direct reports. You will have 4 strong technical EMs reporting to you, as well as 3 world-class staff engineers. We don’t think you need to match their technical competencies (that’s a stretch!), but you have to be able to speak their language, understand problems at their essence, and be able to consolidate and multiply their inputs, including being able to disagree objectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;you have a track record of making level change in the organizations that you lead (rather than 20% change). Consolidating your team views and making coherent strategy out of those views is step one. Step two is even more important: being able to implement these changes in your domain, and more so - across other domains in the marketplace - is a foundational ability you carry. In practice, that means you have at least 2 years of experience leading leaders and 5 years of experience influencing without authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change horizon:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable holding two timeframes at once. We need someone who can say, &quot;Here is what our frontend setup should look like in two years, and here is why&quot; AND name the clear deliverable that has to ship in the first quarter to make that end state reachable. Leaders who only do the second are common. Leaders who only do the first are entertaining. We need both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this role is not:&lt;/strong&gt; This is not a hands-on frontend or release-engineering role. You will not be tuning CI, owning the release train, or reviewing architecture decisions yourself — you’ll have 4 strong EMs and 3 Staff Engineers close to the details, and your job is to turn their technical judgment into direction, alignment, and organizational change. If your strongest work is deep in the mechanics, you&#39;ll be underused here. If your strongest work is changing how 40+ teams operate, you&#39;ll be busy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass (Gym Membership subsidy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with total contribution of 12%, 8% by the Company and 4% by employee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€147.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/vinteden/director-of-engineering-frontend-technologies-marketplace-technologies-amsterdam-284115","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792421718},{"slug":"teamleider-integraal-archiefbeheer-den-haag-44523","company_name":"RocketSourcers B.V.","title":"Teamleider Integraal Archiefbeheer","description":"<h3>Wat ga je doen?</h3><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Wil jij een team verder helpen groeien en bijdragen aan betrouwbaar archiefbeheer binnen de Rijksoverheid? Als Teamleider Integraal Archiefbeheer geef je leiding aan ongeveer 15 medewerkers. Samen zorgen jullie ervoor dat belangrijke overheidsinformatie veilig wordt bewaard, goed vindbaar blijft en zorgvuldig wordt beheerd.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je combineert aandacht voor mensen met kennis van archiefbeheer. Je helpt collega's zich ontwikkelen, verbetert werkprocessen en begeleidt veranderingen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je werkzaamheden zijn onder andere:</p><ul><li><p>Medewerkers begeleiden, coachen en stimuleren in hun ontwikkeling.</p></li><li><p>De kwaliteit, planning en resultaten van het team bewaken.</p></li><li><p>Kennisdeling organiseren tussen collega's met verschillende ervaringsniveaus.</p></li><li><p>Werkprocessen verbeteren en nieuwe technologie toepassen waar dat waarde toevoegt.</p></li><li><p>Samenwerken met andere afdelingen en organisaties binnen de Rijksoverheid.</p></li><li><p>Meedenken over de toekomst van de afdeling en bijdragen aan belangrijke beslissingen.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Uniek aan deze baan</h3><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>In deze functie krijg je de ruimte om echt verschil te maken. Je bouwt aan een team waarin ervaring, nieuwe ideeën en samenwerking samenkomen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je krijgt daarnaast:</p><ul><li><p>Een bruto maandsalaris tussen € 4.132 en € 6.275 bij 36 uur.</p></li><li><p>Een Individueel Keuzebudget van 16,5% van je bruto jaarsalaris.</p></li><li><p>Een jaarcontract met uitzicht op een vast dienstverband.</p></li><li><p>Mogelijkheden voor opleidingen en persoonlijke ontwikkeling.</p></li><li><p>Een volledige vergoeding van je woonwerkverkeer met het openbaar vervoer.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je werkt minimaal vier dagen per week op locatie. Zo blijf je betrokken bij je team en de dagelijkse werkzaamheden.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Wie zijn we?</h3><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>De Rijksorganisatie voor Informatiehuishouding (RvIHH) is onderdeel van het ministerie van Binnenlandse Zaken en Koninkrijksrelaties.</p><p>Wij helpen organisaties binnen de Rijksoverheid om informatie goed te bewaren, te beheren en toegankelijk te houden. Dat doen we met diensten zoals archiefopslag, digitaal informatiebeheer en ondersteuning bij digitale werkprocessen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Binnen de afdeling Integraal Archiefbeheer werken collega's met uiteenlopende kennis en ervaring samen. We leren van elkaar, delen ideeën en zoeken voortdurend naar manieren om onze dienstverlening te verbeteren.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je maakt deel uit van het managementteam en denkt mee over de ontwikkeling van de hele afdeling.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <h3>Wat neem je mee?</h3><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je vindt het leuk om mensen te begeleiden en samen resultaten te bereiken. Je communiceert duidelijk, luistert naar verschillende ideeën en helpt collega's om veranderingen met vertrouwen aan te pakken.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Voor deze functie zijn de volgende kennis en vaardigheden waardevol:</p><ul><li><p>Hbo- of wo-werk- en denkniveau.</p></li><li><p>Ervaring met leidinggeven, coaching en teamontwikkeling.</p></li><li><p>Kennis van archiefwetgeving en recordmanagement: het beheren van documenten en informatie.</p></li><li><p>Inzicht in het verbeteren van processen en dienstverlening.</p></li><li><p>Het vermogen om resultaten te beoordelen en verbeteringen door te voeren.</p></li><li><p>Interesse in technologische ontwikkelingen en hun invloed op het werk.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Herken je jezelf in veel van deze punten, maar niet allemaal? We nodigen je graag uit om te solliciteren. Jouw motivatie, inzichten en ontwikkelbereidheid zijn belangrijk.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/rocketsourcers-bv/teamleider-integraal-archiefbeheer-den-haag-44523","tags":["Rijksorganisatie voor Informatiehuishouding"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Den Haag, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792420272},{"slug":"freelance-back-end-typescript-developer-rotterdam-262875","company_name":"Schubergphilis","title":"Freelance Back End / Typescript Developer","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we build mission-critical IT solutions that power some of the most essential operations of our clients. Reliability, craftsmanship, and continuous improvement are at the heart of everything we do. We are looking for a Senior Freelance TypeScript Software Engineer who enjoys designing and building resilient, high-performance systems that have a direct impact on large-scale operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will help shape the future of critical digital infrastructures, working on complex challenges where software quality, scalability, and reliability truly matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Freelance Software Engineer with an open mind and a genuine passion for software architecture. Together with our customers, we solve a wide range of challenges, from creating more user-friendly online banking platforms and designing business-critical portals and backend systems, to making industrial environments smarter through the combination of cloud technologies and IoT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this specific project, you will work closely with developers and architects to design and build software that connects operator- and customer-facing hardware with a large-scale backend platform supporting parcel logistics operations across an international network of hubs. The platform powers critical parcel handling processes throughout Europe and beyond, serving as a key component in the global logistics chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The platform enables parcel intake, sorting, routing, and grouping processes across distribution hubs. It actively interacts with parcels in real time, processing events generated by scanners, handheld devices, and automated sorting systems. Every parcel moving through the network is represented and tracked by the platform, making it one of the most visible and operationally critical systems within the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this assignment, we are specifically looking for freelance professionals. We offer an initial 6-month contract with the possibility of extension, providing the opportunity to contribute to the continued evolution of a mission-critical platform operating at international scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal colleague brings:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years of professional software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and building microservices and event-driven architectures in cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing backend solutions with TypeScript and Node.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building serverless applications on AWS, particularly with services such as AWS Lambda and DynamoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write high-quality, maintainable, reusable, and well-tested code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large-scale distributed systems processing high volumes of real-time operational events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines, such as GitHub Actions, and modern cloud-native development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating services and APIs within complex enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills and the ability to work closely with engineers and architects to design reliable and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A security-first mindset; practical security experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everyone we work with, and everyone we consider working with, has the right to equal treatment. Our hiring process is designed to be thorough, objective, and fair, ensuring equal opportunities, compensation, and growth for all candidates and colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great teams are built through diversity of thought, background, experience, and perspective. We actively encourage applications from people of different nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and backgrounds, and are committed to fostering an inclusive environment in which everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/schubergphilis/freelance-back-end-typescript-developer-rotterdam-262875","tags":["Technology"],"job_types":[],"location":"Rotterdam","created_at":1792410914},{"slug":"platform-engineer-amsterdam-274679","company_name":"Catawiki","title":"Platform Engineer","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, our Platform Horizontal has evolved from solely managing the cloud into a broad function supporting Reliability, Developer Experience, Security, and Quality. We take a holistic approach to creating systems and tools that help developers deliver applications seamlessly and reliably without getting bogged down in infrastructure complexity.&lt;br&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Platform Engineer&lt;/em&gt;, you’ll work at the intersection of development, infrastructure, and operations. You’ll help shape and execute our long-term platform vision, empowering Catawiki teams to deliver value to customers with speed, reliability, and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build and improve the platform capabilities that enable our engineering teams to develop, deploy, and operate applications effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a self-service developer platform&lt;/strong&gt; with a particular emphasis on developer experience, designing and maintaining platforms that abstract complexity and give teams the tools to deploy, monitor, and optimise their applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate cloud-native infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, manage Kubernetes clusters and other cloud resources, focusing on performance, scalability, and cost efficiency through FinOps practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boost developer productivity&lt;/strong&gt; by building and enhancing CI/CD pipelines, GitOps workflows, and reusable templates that accelerate development and deployment cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive reliability and scalability&lt;/strong&gt; through applying practices for fault tolerance, disaster recovery, and scaling so applications run smoothly under changing conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve platform operations&lt;/strong&gt; usage and enhance our observability stack to monitor platform health and resolve incidents proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate and innovate&lt;/strong&gt; by partnering with product teams to understand their needs, build simple and impactful solutions, and champion cloud-native best practices across Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You measure what matters, introduce changes gradually, and treat failure as a normal part of learning. You use tooling and automation wherever possible to reduce toil, and enjoy sharing knowledge with others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cloud-native expertise&lt;/span&gt;: At least 5 years of production experience with Kubernetes, container orchestration, and cloud platforms such as GCP, AWS, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Automation mindset&lt;/span&gt;: Experience automating workflows and CI/CD pipelines and working with infrastructure-as-code tools such as Terraform or Ansible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Observability experience&lt;/span&gt;: Hands-on experience using and maintaining tools such as Prometheus, Grafana, ELK, or OpenTelemetry to improve reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong ownership&lt;/span&gt;: You proactively address platform issues and work toward long-term scalability and resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative approach: You work effectively with developers and cross-functional teams to align goals and deliver impactful yet simple solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous learning&lt;/span&gt;: You keep developing your knowledge of cloud-native tools, technologies, and practices in a fast-moving ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Horizontal supports engineering teams across Catawiki by reducing infrastructure complexity and providing reliable, secure, and scalable foundations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We collaborate closely with product teams to understand their challenges and improve their development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We favour self-service capabilities, reusable solutions, automation, and measurable, gradual improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We share knowledge and treat reliability, security, quality, and developer experience as shared responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;You will work from our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is open to candidates worldwide. For selected candidates, Catawiki &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;can provide visa sponsorship and relocation support to the relevant location&lt;/span&gt;, subject to eligibility and applicable restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;800+ Catawikians.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/span&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work From Home&lt;/span&gt; Allowance to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commuting&lt;/span&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Office&lt;/span&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/catawiki/platform-engineer-amsterdam-274679","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792400116},{"slug":"stage-event-management-flagship-events-amsterdam-hbo-wo-135671","company_name":"Flagship Amsterdam","title":"Stage Event Management | Flagship Events Amsterdam hbo/wo","description":"<h4><strong>Wat ga je doen?</strong></h4><p>Als Event Management Stagiair(e) bij Flagship Events Amsterdam krijg je de kans om ervaring op te doen binnen sales, marketing én eventmanagement. Je bent betrokken bij het hele traject van een evenement, van het eerste klantcontact tot de uitvoering en evaluatie achteraf. Of het nu gaat om een workshop, teamuitje, sportdag, dinerervaring of een volledig verzorgd bedrijfsevenement: jij zorgt ervoor dat alles goed geregeld wordt. Je helpt bij het uitwerken van aanvragen en denkt mee over passende concepten.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Daarnaast onderhoud je contact met klanten, leveranciers en partners en ondersteun je bij de uitvoering van evenementen. Je volgt aanvragen op, denkt mee over commerciële kansen en ondersteunt bij het creëren van content en campagnes om onze evenementen onder de aandacht te brengen. Je werkt nauw samen met een ervaren collega die je gedurende je stage begeleidt. Hierdoor krijg je veel verantwoordelijkheid, leer je snel en krijg je een goed beeld van hoe commerciële evenementen in de praktijk worden georganiseerd.</p><h4><strong>Wat ga je leren?</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Evenementen van aanvraag tot uitvoering organiseren;</p></li><li><p>Klanten adviseren over de verschillende evenementen en activiteiten die wij aanbieden;</p></li><li><p>Contact onderhouden met klanten, leveranciers en locaties;</p></li><li><p>Ondersteunen bij de uitvoering van evenementen;</p></li><li><p>Foto’s en filmpjes maken op de evenementen;</p></li><li><p>Meedenken over nieuwe manieren om evenementen te verkopen;</p></li><li><p>Feedback van klanten verzamelen en verwerken;</p></li><li><p>Meedenken over verbeteringen voor in de toekomst.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>Praktisch</strong></h4><p><strong>Startdatum:</strong> februari 2027;</p><p><strong>Duur:</strong> minimaal 5 maanden;</p><p><strong>Type stage:</strong> meewerkstage;</p><p><strong>Stagevergoeding:</strong> €500 per maand;</p><p><strong>Locatie:</strong> kantoor in hartje Amsterdam.</p><h4><strong>Wat we aanbieden</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Goede begeleiding van een ervaren collega; </p></li><li><p>Een leerzame stage waarin je kennismaakt met verschillende aspecten van de organisatie en veel praktijkervaring opdoet;</p></li><li><p>Een gezellige lunch met andere teams op ons kantoor in hartje Amsterdam;</p></li><li><p>De mogelijkheid om tijdens je stage je vaarbewijs te behalen;</p></li><li><p>Legendarische bedrijfsfeestjes en teamuitjes;</p></li><li><p>Korting op onze eigen producten, zoals rondvaarten en privébootverhuur.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>Functievereisten</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Je volgt een mbo-, hbo- of wo-opleiding op het gebied van Event Management, Hospitality Management, Sales of een ander relevant vakgebied;</p></li><li><p>Woonachtig